  "overview": "**uStyle** is a light-first design system anchored on `#fcfdfd` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.3:1 contrast) and `#4cc0f4` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `System UI` (32px display down to 16px body), unified by `0px` razor-sharp architectural corners and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nMaintained by **uSwitch**. Source: live stylesheet extraction (https://ustyle.guide/). Inventory: **88** colors, **21** typography steps, and **41** documented components (all rights reserved license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 41 component tokens with documented paddings: `0px`, `0.35em 0.5em`, `0px 1em 0.5em 0px`, `0.35em 40px 0.35em 0.5em`, `10px 26px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#f6f6f7` cards; separate sibling sections using `#a7a7ac` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`0px 2px 2px 0px rgba(204, 204, 204, 0.6)`) paired with `#a7a7ac` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#4cc0f4` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#fcfdfd` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#4cc0f4` with `#0b0b0c` text (9.5:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `System UI` headings with `System UI` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Enforce `0px` border-radius consistently across cards, inputs, and primary buttons.\n- Separate containers via `#f6f6f7` surface shifts and `#a7a7ac` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not apply rounded corners (> 0px) to structural containers or CTA buttons.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `us-form-input` fields and secondary buttons."
}
